	(text "WCH CH9121T UART-to-Ethernet bridge on the SELV side, HR913550AE RJ45 with magnetics,\nSRV05-4, TPS7A2033 3.3 V. NOT FITTED on PV-CTL / PV-CTL-P75: footprints only (DNP)."
